     ],
     "comparison": "S2 8% market-entry ceiling is weaker than the acceptable range (permanent limit must be 5% and above-limit sales must stop); S5 has no numeric mandatory recall (regulator discretion), also weaker than acceptable. S2 benefits Northwind and S5 benefits Halcyon, so each gets a benefiting section weakened in exchange.",
